  "description": "Oakrey.Capsule.Base is a .NET 10 base library for building binary protocol capsules. Each capsule carries a fixed binary header (HardwareId, ProtocolId, Timestamp, Version) and a typed payload. Provides span-based serialization, protocol-ID-keyed deserialization dispatch, and a built-in LoggingCapsule. Designed for extensibility in embedded, IoT, and communication protocol scenarios.",
